obs TAME reflexes kept (opening triad, ≥2 asserts/fn with // invariant, named errors, bounded max_keyring, unqualified assert, no compound assert); tame_style_check + width-check clean. Custody-first held: demo keeper/heir seeds only, no real key/network/seed; gate #4-adjacent untouched. Ed25519 flows through the kumara seam, as the sibling signed apps do.
